.Dd February 27, 2026
.Dt LD 1
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm ld
.Nd Substrate linker wrapper
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl m32 | Fl m64
.Op Fl r | Fl shared | Fl pie | Fl static
.Op Fl o Ar output
.Op Fl L Ar dir
.Op Fl l Ar name
.Op Fl T Ar script
.Op Fl -gc-sections
.Op Fl -strip-all
.Op Fl -allow-undefined
.Ar input ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
invokes a backend system linker and validates produced ELF output with
.Xr libelfobj 3 .
Mode may be inferred from input objects when not explicitly set.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width LD_BACKEND
.It Ev LD_BACKEND
Path/name of backend linker executable. If unset,
.Nm
searches PATH.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr as 1 ,
.Xr cc 1
